  info: Propellers push air down to lift the drone. The size is written like 5.1x4.6
    (length x pitch). Propellers on the diagonal spin the same direction.
  whereItGoes: On top of each motor. Add them last.
  wrongDirectionHelp: Wrong propeller for this motor. Match the CW or CCW mark on
    the propeller with the motor spin direction. A wrong propeller makes the drone
    flip or fail to lift.
